.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-29 17:07:06] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-29T16:57:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T17:07:06+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177663201,"discussion_id":"3a3292b66e4ee833e73c0084dd1111033503f66b","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `flash_attention_score` 算子在 BSH 和 SBH 输入布局下，动态图场景中由于 Head 维度为 `-1` 导致的 `InferShape` 错误。通过在 `InferShapeFlashAttentionScore` 函数中新增对 query/key/value 的 H 维 (`DIM_NUM_2`) 是否为 `-1` 的判断，当任一输入的 H 维为动态维度时，直接将输出的 H 维也设置为 `-1` 并提前返回成功，避免后续基于 `headNum` 的静态推导逻辑在动态场景下产生错误结果。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 BSH/SBH 动态 H 维的提前返回逻辑**: 在 `flash_attention_score_infershape.cpp` 的 `InferShapeFlashAttentionScore` 函数中，于 BSH/SBH 分支的 `headNum` 计算之前，插入了对 `queryShape`、`keyShape`、`valueShape` 的 `DIM_NUM_2` 是否为 `-1` 的检查；若任一为 `-1` 则将 `attentionOutShape` 的 `DIM_NUM_2` 设为 `-1` 并返回 `GRAPH_SUCCESS`，确保动态维度正确传播。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T16:57:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T16:57:38+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177663674,"discussion_id":"32f7dd9558f29183ceac954cacfcf49fd095e812","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3dd7f759b16146a08dcb8b11e5426b56&pipelineRunId=180fd4b1670c42e882a221cbe7f5496e&projectName=CANN'>180fd4b1670c42e882a221cbe7f5496e</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/do